Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Worker workspace: Videos & routes and Documents only

Workers add days from Videos & routes (date, route, route video), so the
separate Upload footage tab, Photos tab and Overview link are hidden for
them and the workspace opens on Videos & routes. Admins keep all tabs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
